id: download-finishes
section: Media and sound
item: A download finishes under /media/internal/downloads (the daemon's [jihad-dl] line); the system's open attempt that follows is the platform's
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-device-build.md R4
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
inject url data:application/octet-stream;base64,SGVsbG8gZnJvbSBKaWhhZAo=
wait line 'jihad-dl.*finished' 30
